  3. **Legacy Fallback Logic**:
     ```kotlin
     val hashSnapshot = hashRef?.let { tx.get(it) }
     val hashExists = hashSnapshot != null && hashSnapshot.exists()
     val canonicalB2Key = if (hashExists) (hashSnapshot?.getString("b2ObjectKey") ?: b2ObjectKey) else b2ObjectKey

     val legacySourceId = hashSnapshot?.getString("sourceId")
     val isSameLogicalFile = if (hashExists && !legacySourceId.isNullOrBlank()) {
         // Modern record with denormalized fields
         legacySourceId == file.sourceId &&
         hashSnapshot.getString("relativePath") == file.relativePath &&
         hashSnapshot.getString("originalName") == file.originalName
